WEBVTT

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:04.270
Dear Paul,
亲爱的保罗：

00:00:05.070 --> 00:00:07.920
Thank you for your interest in the craft demonstration.
感谢你对这次手工艺展示活动的关注。

00:00:08.720 --> 00:00:16.150
Next Friday afternoon, five young craftsmen will come to our campus to show how they breathe new life into traditional crafts.
下周五下午，五位年轻的手艺人将来到我们的校园，展示他们如何让传统手工艺焕发新的生机。

00:00:16.950 --> 00:00:26.120
For example, one will turn traditional paper-cut patterns into 3D-printed ornaments, and another will weave bamboo into stylish modern lamps.
比如，一位会把传统剪纸图案做成3D打印的装饰品，另一位会把竹子编成时尚的现代灯具。

00:00:26.920 --> 00:00:30.650
Visitors will even get the chance to try some of the skills themselves.
参观者甚至还有机会亲自尝试其中一些技艺。

00:00:31.450 --> 00:00:33.440
Your help would be greatly appreciated.
如能得到你的帮助，我们将不胜感激。

00:00:34.240 --> 00:00:41.020
Since you are good at design and photography, could you help design the posters this week and take pictures during the event?
既然你擅长设计和摄影，能否请你这周帮忙设计海报，并在活动期间拍些照片？

00:00:41.820 --> 00:00:43.920
Please let me know if you are available.
请告诉我你是否有空。

00:00:44.720 --> 00:00:45.750
Yours, Li Ming
你的朋友，李明
